---
description: All output content must use English, except for i18n configuration files
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

All output content must use English, except for internationalization (i18n) configuration files. This includes but is not limited to:

- Code comments
- Variable names, function names, class names
- Error messages and log messages
- UI text (unless defined in i18n config files)
- Commit messages
- Documentation

**Exception:** i18n configuration files (e.g., locale JSON files, translation resource files) may contain non-English text as required by the target language.
